---
layout: article
title: Reviews
description: Review pull requests with AI using Appwrite Reviews. Turn it on for GitHub, GitLab, Gitea, and Bitbucket repositories and get findings, a verdict, and a merge confidence grade on every pull request.
---

Appwrite **Reviews** reviews the pull requests in your Git repositories with AI. Turn it on for a repository, and each pull request gets a review where it was opened: a summary, findings on the lines they concern, a verdict, and a merge confidence grade. Mention the reviewer in a comment to ask about a change, request another review, or teach it how your team works.

You turn on reviews and follow them under **Review** in your project.

{% info title="Appwrite Cloud" %}
Reviews is available on Appwrite Cloud.
{% /info %}

